WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.961 --> 00:00:14.751
It a few weeks for the family to adjust to homeschooling for Beth and Amy.

2
00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:18.194
Mother, Meg, and Jo all taught different subjects.

3
00:00:19.095 --> 00:00:24.059
With Beth, it was fairly easy, since they would each assign her a portion to study for the

4
00:00:24.099 --> 00:00:26.581
week, and she could do it at her leisure.

5
00:00:27.442 --> 00:00:33.725
Being an obedient and grateful girl, Beth never neglected her lessons, making sure she finished all the work

6
00:00:33.785 --> 00:00:36.126
first before she allowed time for herself.

7
00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:38.627
Even going to Mr.

8
00:00:38.647 --> 00:00:44.048
Laurence's every day, as well as playing on her own little piano, did not distract her from carrying

9
00:00:44.148 --> 00:00:44.968
on with her studies.

10
00:00:46.249 --> 00:00:50.310
Amy, on the other hand, found out that she was not as disciplined as her sister.

11
00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:53.051
"Oh, Beth, can we please take a break?

12
00:00:53.451 --> 00:00:54.631
I'm exhausted!"

13
00:00:55.011 --> 00:00:58.012
she cried one afternoon as she struggled with a math problem.

14
00:00:59.008 --> 00:01:05.812
"We just had a break, Amy, and besides, Jo wants us to finish this today," said Beth, pointing

15
00:01:05.852 --> 00:01:07.694
to the books stacked on the dining table.

16
00:01:08.654 --> 00:01:13.457
Since Beth and Amy were studying together, Mother felt it best to set aside a certain period of

17
00:01:13.537 --> 00:01:15.498
time each day for the girls' lessons.

18
00:01:16.299 --> 00:01:22.203
Both Meg and Jo came home around the same time, so they took turns teaching the younger girls

19
00:01:22.283 --> 00:01:24.024
for a few hours every afternoon.

20
00:01:25.004 --> 00:01:30.467
Three times a week, Mother stayed home in the morning to help the girls with other subjects, and

21
00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:35.270
on the days that Mother went out for her volunteer work, Beth and Amy were given homework to

22
00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:40.032
do. "I hope Jo never becomes a real teacher," complained Amy.

23
00:01:40.052 --> 00:01:42.834
"I would pity her students if she did.

24
00:01:43.614 --> 00:01:45.615
Just look at how much she gives us to do!

25
00:01:46.196 --> 00:01:48.597
How can I possibly read all that?"

26
00:01:49.678 --> 00:01:53.620
Amy spread her hand toward the books and dramatically flung her pencil down.

27
00:01:54.904 --> 00:02:01.046
"Well, if you would stop wasting time complaining and actually start reading, then maybe you could finish your

28
00:02:01.066 --> 00:02:07.568
assignment by the time you're 20," joked Jo as she came into the room carrying more thick textbooks,

29
00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:09.148
which she threw on the table.

30
00:02:09.168 --> 00:02:13.369
"Jo!" shrieked Amy.

31
00:02:13.389 --> 00:02:14.790
"What is that?

32
00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:18.091
Don't tell me we have to do more math problems?"

33
00:02:19.051 --> 00:02:24.325
"You don't have to do all of them tonight," Jo reassured her sister, who let out a sigh

34
00:02:24.345 --> 00:02:24.825
of relief.

35
00:02:26.046 --> 00:02:30.728
Then Jo immediately added, "Some of this is for tomorrow night, since we won't be here."

36
00:02:32.069 --> 00:02:34.090
Amy sat up straight and narrowed her eyes.

37
00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:35.871
"Why not?

38
00:02:36.311 --> 00:02:37.232
Where are you going?

39
00:02:38.453 --> 00:02:39.613
Is Meg going with you?"

40
00:02:39.954 --> 00:02:40.634
she questioned.

41
00:02:41.274 --> 00:02:47.778
Chuckling to herself, Jo flapped a hand at her and said, "It's none of your business.

42
00:02:48.599 --> 00:02:50.920
Now have you solved that problem yet or not?"

43
00:02:51.976 --> 00:02:56.259
Just then Meg rushed in, her cheeks flushed and eyes bright with excitement.

44
00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.581
She secretly whispered something in Jo's ear.

45
00:03:00.262 --> 00:03:04.004
Giggling and speaking in hushed tones, the two girls left the room swiftly.

46
00:03:04.024 --> 00:03:06.926
"That's not nice!

47
00:03:07.227 --> 00:03:09.388
You shouldn't whisper in front of others!"

48
00:03:09.848 --> 00:03:10.989
Amy yelled after them.

49
00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:17.173
Frustrated, hungry, and cranky, Amy vowed to find out what her sisters were up to.

50
00:03:18.194 --> 00:03:20.756
The March sisters rarely kept secrets from each other.

51
00:03:21.544 --> 00:03:25.346
No wonder Amy found it odd that her sisters would not share their news with her.

52
00:03:26.167 --> 00:03:28.928
She had no choice but to find out on her own.

53
00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:35.412
The next afternoon, both Meg and Jo disappeared into their room as soon as they returned from work.

54
00:03:36.392 --> 00:03:41.515
Amy could hear a great deal of running around, closet doors opening and shutting, and worst of all,

55
00:03:42.016 --> 00:03:42.856
lots of laughter.

56
00:03:44.317 --> 00:03:50.961
Feeling particularly grumpy that day, Amy left Beth to figure out the math equation, and crept upstairs to

57
00:03:51.001 --> 00:03:51.862
her sisters' room.

58
00:03:52.842 --> 00:03:55.444
Luckily for her, the door was slightly open.

59
00:03:55.464 --> 00:03:58.387
"Jo, can you help me with my hair?"

60
00:03:58.747 --> 00:03:59.407
Meg was saying.

61
00:03:59.427 --> 00:04:06.753
"As soon as I tie this big Christmas ribbon around my waist," Jo replied, struggling with a satin

62
00:04:06.793 --> 00:04:09.275
sash that wound around her dark purple dress.

63
00:04:10.276 --> 00:04:15.640
Giggling, Meg helped her clumsy sister, creating a perfect bow at the back of her dress.

64
00:04:16.872 --> 00:04:19.955
"There, that's better," she laughed cheerfully.

65
00:04:20.876 --> 00:04:24.258
Then through the mirror, she caught sight of an uninvited guest.

66
00:04:25.319 --> 00:04:28.282
"I think we have a visitor," she remarked to Jo.

67
00:04:29.163 --> 00:04:31.865
Jo swung around and caught Amy peering through the door.

68
00:04:31.885 --> 00:04:33.867
"What are you doing?

69
00:04:34.547 --> 00:04:36.949
And why aren't you downstairs doing your lessons?"

70
00:04:37.229 --> 00:04:37.730
she barked.

71
00:04:38.771 --> 00:04:43.034
Amy stubbornly cocked her head and replied nastily, "Where are you going?

72
00:04:43.054 --> 00:04:44.936
Does Mother know?

73
00:04:45.576 --> 00:04:47.257
If she doesn't, I'm going to tell."

74
00:04:48.458 --> 00:04:51.941
Jo pinched Amy hard on her arm causing her to squeal like a pig.

75
00:04:51.961 --> 00:04:54.142
"You nasty little worm!

76
00:04:54.523 --> 00:04:56.364
I told you to mind your own business!

77
00:04:57.284 --> 00:05:01.908
As for whether or not Mother knows, do you think we'd sneak around behind Mother's back without getting

78
00:05:01.948 --> 00:05:03.209
her permission to go out?"

79
00:05:03.549 --> 00:05:04.269
Jo shouted.

80
00:05:04.289 --> 00:05:05.951
"You hurt me!

81
00:05:06.091 --> 00:05:07.512
My arm is bruised!"

82
00:05:07.812 --> 00:05:10.133
moaned Amy, rubbing the red spot on her arm.

83
00:05:10.154 --> 00:05:12.075
"Serves you right!"

84
00:05:12.495 --> 00:05:13.416
said Jo sternly.

85
00:05:13.916 --> 00:05:16.097
"Now go downstairs and do your lessons!"

86
00:05:16.117 --> 00:05:19.819
"Just tell me where you're going then," cried Amy.

87
00:05:19.839 --> 00:05:22.321
"Jo, why don't we just tell her?"

88
00:05:22.701 --> 00:05:24.382
Meg said, trying to make peace.

89
00:05:24.402 --> 00:05:28.264
"Fine, but don't start crying because you can't come!"

90
00:05:28.844 --> 00:05:31.146
Jo turned her back and continued to get ready.

91
00:05:31.886 --> 00:05:39.430
Meg gently rubbed Amy's arm and began in her motherly way, "Laurie has invited us to―" But before

92
00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:45.481
she could finish, Amy interrupted by screaming, "You're going to the theater!

93
00:05:45.521 --> 00:05:47.182
You're going to see that play!

94
00:05:47.202 --> 00:05:48.122
I wanted to see it!

95
00:05:48.462 --> 00:05:50.123
I'm the one who told you about it!"

96
00:05:50.983 --> 00:05:56.046
Neither Meg nor Jo could deny it, for it was indeed Amy who had mentioned the very theater

97
00:05:56.086 --> 00:05:57.406
production a few weeks ago.

98
00:05:58.267 --> 00:06:00.047
She had heard about it from her friend Kitty.

99
00:06:00.067 --> 00:06:08.331
"Well, darling, Laurie already saw it and he didn't think it was suitable for young ones Meg tried

100
00:06:08.371 --> 00:06:10.052
to reason with her frantic sister.

101
00:06:11.276 --> 00:06:12.376
"That's not fair!

102
00:06:12.756 --> 00:06:13.657
I want to go!

103
00:06:13.977 --> 00:06:16.758
Please, I'm very mature for my age!"

104
00:06:17.138 --> 00:06:18.598
Amy continued to argue.

105
00:06:18.618 --> 00:06:25.640
"Well, I know you are, but, well, maybe if we ask Meg struggled to find the right words

106
00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:26.161
to say.

107
00:06:26.181 --> 00:06:31.202
"No!" Jo slammed the closet door and stamped her feet.

108
00:06:31.222 --> 00:06:33.683
"No, no, no!

109
00:06:34.143 --> 00:06:37.064
You are not coming with us because you are not invited!

110
00:06:38.076 --> 00:06:42.539
If you're as mature as you say you are, stop screaming like a monkey, and get back to

111
00:06:42.579 --> 00:06:43.399
your lessons!"

112
00:06:43.419 --> 00:06:45.840
"I hate you, Jo March!

113
00:06:46.261 --> 00:06:47.181
I hate you!"

114
00:06:47.581 --> 00:06:49.542
Amy screamed at the top of her lungs.

115
00:06:49.562 --> 00:06:53.224
"You're going to pay for this!

116
00:06:53.545 --> 00:06:55.766
I swear you're going to be sorry!"

117
00:06:56.446 --> 00:07:00.849
Amy collapsed on the floor, wailing and throwing her fists around in frustration.

118
00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:08.145
Jo, grabbing her bag, stepped right over her, and when she got to the door, turned around one

119
00:07:08.205 --> 00:07:13.588
last time and said in a spiteful voice, "You'd better not be in here when we get back.

120
00:07:14.389 --> 00:07:18.452
And you'd better have finished the work I gave you or else you're in big trouble, young lady!"

121
00:07:19.392 --> 00:07:24.776
Meg, looking apologetically at her youngest sister, quietly followed Jo out of the room.

122
00:07:24.796 --> 00:07:30.499
"I promise you will pay for this, Josephine March," sniffed Amy.
